    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-012",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s all I know about {him}, and it’s more than I wanted to.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap",
      "knows": "relation"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-013",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s all I saw.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-014",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I wasn’t watching for anybody in particular.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-015",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t keep a clock on people. I just notice.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-016",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’ve got better things to do than keep count of people, most nights.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-017",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "People think nobody sees them. Somebody always does.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-018",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s all.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-019",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Make of it what you like.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-020",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s what I saw. What it means is your end of it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "movements",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-021",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "And I know most people around here.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-022",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "If I knew {him}, I’d tell you. I tell people everything.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-023",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "The name means nothing to me.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-024",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Sorry. I’d help you if I could.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-025",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "No.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "knowing",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-026",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Some nights I could count them on one hand.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-027",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "It’s not a busy place, whatever anybody tells you.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-028",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I keep count. It’s a habit, like biting your nails.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-029",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s the lot.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-030",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s all of them.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-031",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t miss many.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-032",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s the count.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-033",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Numbers I can give you.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "counts",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-034",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Half the people through here I wouldn’t know again, and the other half I’d rather not.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-035",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "They don’t stop to be known, and I don’t ask.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-036",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "A stranger’s a stranger. You can’t make friends with everybody.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-037",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "They came and went.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-038",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I didn’t think anything of it at the time.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-039",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Faces. That’s all they were.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-040",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t ask.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "strangers",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-041",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "You could set a clock by it, and people do.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-042",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "It’s about the only thing around here that’s on time.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-043",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s when it was.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-044",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’m sure of that much.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-045",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Ask anybody.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "timing",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-046",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Nobody who was there could have missed it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "event",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-047",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "People talked about nothing else for an hour.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "event",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-048",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s how it was.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "event",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-049",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s all I can tell you about it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "event",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-050",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Not much of a night, when you say it out loud.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-051",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’ve had better evenings. I’ve had worse.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-052",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "You’d think I’d have more to show for it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-053",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s my evening.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-054",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "It’s not much, but it’s mine.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-055",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s all you get.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-056",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "Write it down if you like.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "evening",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-057",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t say it to make trouble. I say it because it’s so.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-058",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "People talk. I listen. It isn’t a crime.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-059",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I could tell you more about this street than the street would like.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-060",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s what I know.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-061",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’m only telling you what I know.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-062",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s all I’ll say about it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-063",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "You didn’t hear it from me.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "thing",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-064",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I’ve told you what I know.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-065",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s the truth, for what it’s worth.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "plain"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-066",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "I don’t know why anybody would lie about a thing like that.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-067",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "There. Now you know as much as I do.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "yap"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "tai-068",
    "deck": "tail",
    "text": "That’s it.",
    "tags": {
      "family": "any",
      "temper": "enigma"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  }
]
